1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
It’s 2:00 A.M.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,100
Your head is pounding,

3
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,600
and the only painkiller left in your cabinet expired three years ago.

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,200
You swallow it anyway.

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,500
Within 60 seconds, that pill hits your stomach acid.
